WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.992
[VIDEO GAME BEEPING]

00:00:04.252 --> 00:00:06.210
MARK MIRCHANDANI: Google
Cloud Natural Language

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.010
reveals the structure
and meaning of text

00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:10.040
by offering powerful
machine learning models

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:12.666
in an easy-to-use REST API.

00:00:12.666 --> 00:00:14.790
You can use it to extract
information about places,

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:16.359
events, and much more.

00:00:16.359 --> 00:00:18.150
You can also use it to
understand sentiment

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:20.100
about your product
on social media,

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.620
or parse intent from customer
conversations happening

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:24.930
in a call center
or messaging app.

00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:27.210
You can analyze text
uploaded in your request

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:29.005
or integrate with
your document storage

00:00:29.005 --> 00:00:31.090
on Google Cloud Storage.

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:33.420
Let's try this API
with this sentence.

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:35.670
Google, headquartered
in Mountain View,

00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:38.280
unveiled the new Android phone
at the Consumer Electronics

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:39.150
Show.

00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:40.710
Sundar Pichai said
in his keynote

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:43.802
that users love their
new Android phones.

00:00:43.802 --> 00:00:45.510
All right, now let's
see what information

00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:46.980
the API has given us.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.230
We can see that it shows the
entities in the sentence,

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:52.090
the sentiment, syntax,
and even classified

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:54.779
which categories the
sentence could belong in.

00:00:54.779 --> 00:00:56.820
You don't have just English
to work with, either.

00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:58.986
Cloud Natural Language
enables you to easily analyze

00:00:58.986 --> 00:01:01.890
text in multiple languages,
including English,

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:04.300
Spanish, Japanese, Chinese--

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:06.000
both simplified
and traditional--

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:10.640
French, German, Italian,
Korean, and Portuguese.

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:13.690
In just 40 minutes you'll learn
how to use this powerful API.

00:01:13.690 --> 00:01:15.780
So let's head over to Qwiklabs.

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:18.240
In this lab you'll
create an API key,

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:20.160
create an entity
analysis request,

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:23.086
and then call the
Natural Language API.

00:01:23.086 --> 00:01:24.960
This self-paced lab is
part of the Baseline--

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:28.140
Data, ML, and AI
quest on Qwiklabs.

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:29.730
Completing all the
labs in this quest

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:32.930
earns you this badge to
recognize your new skills.

